Independent SLH wallet interface comparison tools

These tools reuse the separate Transparent PQ Python wallet format reference
through ../formats/reference.py, whose upstream source, MIT/Apache-2.0 license
and adaptations are retained in ../formats/NOTICE and ../formats/sources.json.
Research source: https://github.com/jonwalch/zcash-transparent-pq
Pinned revision: da638d4045074f7957aec3fb3fb018bd66b96d05

The deterministic watch companion retains the public schema of the research
watch, scan and payment modules; schema/hash mappings are in sources.json.
Key-exchange and operational-receipt envelopes are specified by the product
modules recorded there. Production functions never compute oracle answers.
The product wallet's existing MIT and Apache-2.0 licenses are available at
crates/pq-wallet/LICENSE-MIT and crates/pq-wallet/LICENSE-APACHE.

Existing H1 public keys and L1 inventory/encrypted backup are reused unchanged,
with their original attribution and hash checks. All material is public test
data. The synthetic participant identities and metadata confer no ownership,
authority or security assurance.
